 <19914760+geraldoantonio@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 13:25:13 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] frontend: free the right scandir entry
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

game_list_init_nocache() freed namelist[n], one past the end of the
array returned by scandir(), on every iteration, instead of
namelist[i]. That is undefined behaviour and can abort the GUI.

Upstream: not sent, the project is unmaintained.

Signed-off-by: Geraldo Júnior <19914760+geraldoantonio@users.noreply.github.com>
---
 unix/frontend.cpp | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/unix/frontend.cpp b/unix/frontend.cpp
index b88b8ed..35c97bb 100644
--- a/unix/frontend.cpp
+++ b/unix/frontend.cpp
@@ -278,7 +278,7 @@ static void game_list_init_nocache(void)
 				if (strcasecmp(namelist[i]->d_name, "dir.txt") != 0)
 					strcpy(fe_drivers[game_num_avail++].name,  namelist[i]->d_name);
 			}
-			free(namelist[n]);
+			free(namelist[i]);
 		}
 		free(namelist);
 	}
